    "title": "Woof woof, arf arf - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Subscriptions ,\n1 hours ago It snowed last night. I can smell it, even if I can’t see it from my bed. What they say about a dog’s sense of smell being 20,000 times better than a human’s? Right, I guess, even if I don’t know what “20,000 times better” means. I’ll just say I can smell it when it snows, so I don’t need to get up out of bed and look out the window. Like He does. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
